OL,3,GNEWSAMajor search for teenager missing
OL,4,Aoff coast called off
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major sea search operation for a
OL,7,Fmissing 14-year-old boy has been called
OL,8,Foff after two days, the Coastguard has
OL,9,Fsaid.
OL,11,FAt about 15:30 BST on Sunday, HM
OL,12,FCoastguard received a report that three
OL,13,Fpeople were experiencing difficulty in
OL,14,Fthe water at Marloes Sands beach,
OL,15,FPembrokeshire, and required assistance.
OL,17,FTwo were able to self-rescue, escaping
OL,18,Fdifficulty themselves, but a teenage
OL,19,Fboy was unaccounted for. The search for
OL,20,Fthe 14-year-old was suspended at 19:30
OL,21,FBST on Monday evening.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
